{
  "mn94:0.1": "Middle Discourses 94 ",
  "mn94:0.2": "With Ghoṭamukha ",
  "mn94:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "mn94:1.2": "At one time Venerable Udena was staying near Varanasi in the Khemiya Mango Grove. ",
  "mn94:2.1": "Now at that time the brahmin Ghoṭamukha had arrived at Varanasi on some business. ",
  "mn94:2.2": "Then as he was going for a walk he went to the Khemiya Mango Grove. ",
  "mn94:2.3": "At that time Venerable Udena was walking mindfully in the open air. ",
  "mn94:2.4": "Ghoṭamukha approached and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "mn94:2.5": "Walking alongside Udena, he said, ",
  "mn94:2.6": "“My ascetic, there is no such thing as a principled renunciate life; ",
  "mn94:2.7": "that’s what I think. ",
  "mn94:2.8": "Yet I have not seen honorable ones such as yourself, or a relevant teaching.” ",
  "mn94:3.1": "When he said this, Udena stepped down from the walking path, entered his dwelling, and sat down on the seat spread out. ",
  "mn94:3.2": "Ghoṭamukha also stepped down from the walking path and entered the dwelling, where he stood to one side. ",
  "mn94:3.3": "Udena said to him, ",
  "mn94:3.4": "“There are seats, brahmin. ",
  "mn94:3.5": "Please sit if you wish.” ",
  "mn94:3.6": "“I was just waiting for you to sit down. ",
  "mn94:3.7": "For how on earth could one such as I presume to sit first without being invited?” ",
  "mn94:4.1": "Then he took a low seat and sat to one side, ",
  "mn94:4.2": "where he said, ",
  "mn94:4.3": "“My ascetic, there is no s